Subject: [PATCH] Add READ_ONLY write-freeze guard to mutating API routes

Implements plan-migrate-to-innotofuture.md M1: when READ_ONLY=1 (or
"true") is set on a worker, the three mutating routes (builds/start,
secrets, wizard/submit) refuse writes with 503 after auth, before any
D1/CF/pipeline side effect. Shared helper in src/lib/read-only.ts, env
read at call time. 6 vitest cases; full suite (54) + tsc green.
